<title>UK: Shell up on Showa results, broker comments.</title>
<headline>Shell up on Showa results, broker comments.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Shell Transport firmed on Friday after Showa Shell Sekiyu, in which Shell holds a 50 percent stake, posted strong annual results, dealers said.</p>
<p>ABN AMRO Hoare Govett reiterated its &quot;buy&quot; recommendation on Shell shares, which also boosted the market, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1018 GMT, shares in Shell were up 10p to 1083-1/2.</p>
</text>
